Do not change humanoid_rl_gym obs format unless also updating MuJoCo deploy.
Do not export stochastic SAC actions; deployment must use deterministic `torch.tanh(mean)`.
Do not use the current 37-DoF IsaacLab checkpoint for this 29-DoF path.
